                                "example_id": "6bf71655-660c-476e-b6df-8d5343d1c445",
                                "sense_id": "5ee76587-a4a9-347d-a677-17fbcf79ab69",
                                "text": "Будь настороже́.",
                                "translation": "Be on guard / on the lookout.",
                                "english": "Be on guard / on the lookout."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6d59a306-4c60-4bc9-9068-ccbc2b72cb82",
                                "sense_id": "5ee76587-a4a9-347d-a677-17fbcf79ab69",
                                "text": "Он боялся всего: и того, что его схватят, закуют и сошлют в Сибирь или просто убьют, и потому был настороже.",
                                "translation": "He feared everything: that he might be seized, chained, and sent to Siberia, or simply killed; and therefore he was on his guard.",
                                "english": "He feared everything: that he might be seized, chained, and sent to Siberia, or simply killed; and therefore he was on his guard."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
